"An internal or external auditor can consult this audit only: its controls, "
"the progress, the requests already submitted with their submitted documents, "
"and the findings. Documents still being prepared, the working documents and "
"the notes of the audit stay hidden. The access ends on its end date and can "
"be revoked at any time; every download is recorded in the \"Document "
"access\" tab."
