msgid ""
"The processes are the ISMS activities of the responsibility matrix. The "
"processes chosen here fill the multi-year audit programme and are used to "
"check the independence of the auditors."
msgstr ""
"I processi sono le attività del SGSI della matrice delle responsabilità. I "
